  "releaseNotes": "1. Updated all Dapper methods to include CancellationToken, use Transaction and have the connectionName nullable.  \n2. ConnectionString will only be set from IConfigration if connectionName is passed otherwise will use what is set by user for ConnectionString property. \n3. Additional constructor is available that does not inject the IConfiguration.  This allows the user to set the ConnectionString property directly without having to use appsettings.json.\n4. The ConnectionTimeoutSeconds will only be set in the methods if it has a value passed otherwise will use what the user set for the ConnectionTimeoutSeconds property.",
